{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"main_16_level_spst_16-04","storyGroup":"main_16","storySort":260,"storyDependence":"main_16_level_spst_16-04","storyCanShow":0,"storyCode":"EG-10","storyName":"无前","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"善人的布施，终将抵达大地的每一个角落。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"obt/main/level_spst_16-04","avgTag":"幕间","unLockType":"STAGE_CLEAR","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"spst_16-04","minState":"PASS","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":23,"characters":["感染者矿工","远处的声音","？？？","急切的声音","虔诚的声音","许多人的声音","希尔达"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":4},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c8/Avg_bg_66_g8_farnorthtundra_aurora.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":5},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":6},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_monastery_nomal.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":7,"musicid":0},{"type":"subtitle","text":"呼……呼……","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":8},{"type":"subtitle","text":"疼……石头在肉里疯长……几乎能听见声音。为什么我还没死掉？","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":9},{"type":"subtitle","text":"没有力气，四肢不受控制……跑！往东跑！","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":10},{"type":"subtitle","text":"往南是送死，往北也是送死。往西……如果远北都出事了，西部那些矿场也不可能幸免。","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":11},{"type":"subtitle","text":"可逃跑能逃出远北……又要逃到哪里才能逃出痛苦？","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":12},{"type":"subtitle","id":13},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":14},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":15},{"type":"dialog","id":16},{"type":"animtext","id":17,"name":"group_location_stamp","style":"avg_only_heavy","pos":"-400,-200","block":"false","text":"<p=1>乌萨斯远北边界，荒野</>"},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":18},{"type":"animtextclean","id":19},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":20},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1969_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":21},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":22},{"type":"dialogue","name":"感染者矿工","text":"呃……","id":23,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_avg_npc_1969_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"感染者矿工","text":"我跑……不动……了……","id":24,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_avg_npc_1969_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"感染者矿工","text":"就到，这里……","id":25,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_avg_npc_1969_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":26},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_snowbodyfall","id":27},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"0,-60","duration":"0.7","afrom":"1","ato":"0","id":28},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":29},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"2","ystrength":"10","vibrato":"10","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":30},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":31},{"type":"dialogue","name":"感染者矿工","text":"……","id":32},{"type":"dialog","id":33},{"type":"charslot","id":34},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_snowbootwalk","volume":"0.5","id":35},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":36},{"type":"dialogue","name":"远处的声音","text":"那边好像有人？","id":37},{"type":"dialogue","name":"远处的声音","text":"我去看看——","id":38},{"type":"dialogue","name":"远处的声音","text":"……不，请让我去吧……","id":39},{"type":"dialogue","name":"远处的声音","text":"我感觉到那只是一个受过许多苦痛的人。","id":40},{"type":"dialog","id":41},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_snowbootwalk","id":42},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1719_1#2$1","duration":"1","id":43},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":44},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"脱力，脱水，许久未曾进食……","id":45,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/74/Avg_avg_npc_1719_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"你也是感染者。","id":46,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/74/Avg_avg_npc_1719_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":47},{"type":"dialogue","name":"感染者矿工","text":"咳、咳咳！","id":48},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":49},{"type":"dialogue","name":"急切的声音","text":"同胞，他也是我们的同胞！","id":50},{"type":"dialogue","name":"急切的声音","text":"请您救救他吧，就像您救我们所有人一样——","id":51},{"type":"dialogue","name":"急切的声音","text":"再一次施行您的神迹！","id":52},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1719_1#2$1","id":53},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"那不是神迹……唉。","id":54,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/74/Avg_avg_npc_1719_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"矿石病不是使他如此痛苦的主要原因，我只能使他不再因疾病而疼痛，却不能使他饱腹、给他干净的水喝、让他有安全的地方入睡。","id":55,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/74/Avg_avg_npc_1719_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1719_1#4$1","id":56},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"我无法施行神迹，我并非全能，我只是……相信。","id":57,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_npc_1719_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":58},{"type":"dialogue","name":"虔诚的声音","text":"您总是这样谦逊，我们都明白。","id":59},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1719_1#2$1","id":60},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"……先生，您还能听见我说话吗？","id":61,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/74/Avg_avg_npc_1719_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"接下来，我会握住您的手……","id":62,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/74/Avg_avg_npc_1719_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":63},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1719_1#3$1","id":64},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":65},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"“相信吧。相信我们的生命。”","id":66,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_npc_1719_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"“相信我们的身体与思维，相信我们心脏的每一次律动，相信我们肺叶的每一次收放。”","id":67,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_npc_1719_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"“相信我们自身，是一切力量的来源。”","id":68,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_npc_1719_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"从此，您不必再生活在对死亡的恐惧中。","id":69,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_npc_1719_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":70},{"type":"text","text":"源石在体内迅速生长带来的疼痛逐渐远去。","id":71},{"type":"text","text":"他仍能听见那些声音，却不再因此疼得辗转反侧。","id":72},{"type":"dialogue","name":"感染者矿工","text":"你——你是谁？","id":73},{"type":"dialogue","name":"感染者矿工","text":"你救了我……","id":74},{"type":"dialogue","name":"感染者矿工","text":"咳、咳咳，咳——","id":75},{"type":"dialogue","name":"感染者矿工","text":"我该怎么，感谢你？","id":76},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1719_1#2$1","id":77},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"您可以像这里所有的兄弟姊妹一样，称呼我为“希尔达”。","id":78,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/74/Avg_avg_npc_1719_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":79},{"type":"dialogue","name":"急切的声音","text":"神迹——","id":80},{"type":"dialogue","name":"急切的声音","text":"希尔达再一次救了我们的同胞！","id":81},{"type":"dialogue","name":"急切的声音","text":"她救了我们所有人，只是用母亲一样的抚摸，就像刚才一样，抹去了所有的病痛！","id":82},{"type":"dialogue","name":"急切的声音","text":"希尔达！","id":83},{"type":"dialogue","name":"虔诚的声音","text":"希尔达。","id":84},{"type":"dialogue","name":"许多人的声音","text":"希尔达！","id":85},{"type":"charslot","id":86},{"type":"dialogue","name":"感染者矿工","text":"希尔达……希尔达。","id":87},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1719_1#2$1","id":88},{"type":"dialogue","name":"希尔达","text":"是的，那是我的名字。","id":89,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/74/Avg_avg_npc_1719_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":90},{"type":"dialogue","name":"感染者矿工","text":"你长什么模样？无论是你，还是其他说话的人，我都看不清……","id":91},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1719_1#1$1","id":92},{"type":"dialogue","name":"希尔达","text":"您的头上有伤，是跑得太急，在哪里跌了一跤，将头都撞破了吗？","id":93,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/df/Avg_avg_npc_1719_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"希尔达","text":"也许是脑中的淤血让您看不清。没关系，我们可以搀扶着您……","id":94,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/df/Avg_avg_npc_1719_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"希尔达","text":"告诉我，您接下来要去哪里？","id":95,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/df/Avg_avg_npc_1719_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":96},{"type":"dialogue","name":"感染者矿工","text":"我不知道……","id":97},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1719_1#2$1","id":98},{"type":"dialogue","name":"希尔达","text":"那就先同我们一起吧。","id":99,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/74/Avg_avg_npc_1719_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":100},{"type":"dialogue","name":"虔诚的声音","text":"您要带我们去一个没有痛苦的地方，对不对？","id":101},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1719_1#2$1","id":102},{"type":"dialogue","name":"希尔达","text":"是的，只要你们仍愿意与我同行……","id":103,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/74/Avg_avg_npc_1719_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":104},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":105},{"type":"charslot","id":106},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":107},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/79/Avg_bg_60_g9_seasurface_ex.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":108},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":109},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":110},{"type":"dialogue","name":"希尔达","text":"只要我们相信。","id":111},{"type":"dialog","id":112},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":113},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":114},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":115},{"type":"hidecgitem","id":116},{"type":"image","id":117},{"type":"charslot","text":"","id":118}],"characters":["感染者矿工","远处的声音","？？？","急切的声音","虔诚的声音","许多人的声音","希尔达"]}